OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CConvicted rapist who abused wife was   
OL,5,C'master manipulator'                   
OL,6,GA woman whose husband raped and        
OL,7,Gsexually assaulted her has said he was 
OL,8,Ga "master manipulator who knew exactly 
OL,9,Gwhat he was doing".                    
OL,11,FJoanne Donald reported the abuse,      
OL,12,Fwhich had happened "hundreds of times  
OL,13,Fover the years", to the Police Service 
OL,14,Fof Northern Ireland (PSNI) in 2019.    
OL,16,FMichael Donald, 50, from Belfast, was  
OL,17,Fconvicted by a jury of three counts of 
OL,18,Frape and three counts of sexual        
OL,19,Fassault.                               
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
