OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CState and police apologies must be     
OL,5,Cbacked by action, Finucane inquiry told
OL,6,GFresh UK government and police         
OL,7,Gapologies over the murder of Belfast   
OL,8,Gsolicitor Pat Finucane must be backed  
OL,9,Gby action, the chairman of the public  
OL,10,Ginquiry into the murder has said.      
OL,12,FSir Gary Hickinbottom was speaking at  
OL,13,Fthe conclusion of opening statements   
OL,14,Ffrom core participants.                
OL,16,FFinucane, 39, was shot by the Ulster   
OL,17,FDefence Association (UDA) at home in   
OL,18,Ffront of his wife and children in 1989.
OL,20,FPolice and Army agents were involved.  
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
